+    -> ``load`` (tail stage: allocate the lm_head + selector copy inside the
+    model's memory profile) -> ``finalize`` after CUDA-graph capture (every
+    stage: agree, copy the weights, warm the tail up, go live). Until
+    ``finalize`` every step keeps the tail on the last stage.
